# My Tmux Cheat Sheet (Prefix = `Ctrl + Space`)

Prefix key is set to **`Ctrl + Space`** instead of the default `Ctrl + b`.

---

## Core Navigation & Management

- `prefix` = `Ctrl + Space`
- `prefix + :` → Open tmux command prompt
- `prefix + d` → Detach session
- `prefix + r` → Reload tmux config (custom)

---

## Windows

| Action                    | Shortcut                 | Notes                                              |
|---------------------------|--------------------------|----------------------------------------------------|
| New window                | `prefix + c`             |                                                    |
| Rename window             | `prefix + ,`             |                                                    |
| List windows              | `prefix + w`             | Navigate with arrows or j/k, press Enter to select |
| Next window               | `prefix + n`             |                                                    |
| Previous window           | `prefix + p`             |                                                    |
| Switch by number          | `prefix + [0–9]`         |                                                    |
| Close window              | `prefix + &`             | Confirms before closing                            |

---

## Sessions

| Action                       | Shortcut / Command                      | Notes                                  |
|------------------------------|-------------------------------------------|-----------------------------------------|
| List sessions                | `prefix + s` / `tmux ls`                  |                                        |
| Switch session (prev/next)   | `prefix + (` / `prefix + )`              |                                        |
| Switch to named session      | `tmux switch -t <name>`                  |                                        |
| Rename session               | `prefix + :` → `rename-session <name>`   |                                        |
| Attach to session            | `tmux attach -t <name>`                 | From outside tmux                      |
| Create new session           | `tmux new -s <name>`                    |                                        |

---

## Panes (Splits)

| Action                     | Shortcut                        | Notes                                     |
|----------------------------|----------------------------------|--------------------------------------------|
| Split vertically           | `prefix + |`                    | Custom                                     |
| Split horizontally         | `prefix + -`                    | Custom                                     |
| Move between panes         | `prefix + Arrow Keys`          |                                           |
| Resize pane                | `prefix + Alt + Arrow Keys`    | Custom                                     |
| Swap panes                 | `prefix + o`                   |                                           |
| Close pane                 | `prefix + x`                   | Confirm with `y`                          |
| Zoom / unzoom pane         | `prefix + z`                   | Fullscreen a pane temporarily             |
| Exit pane                  | `exit` or `Ctrl + d`           | Shell-level                               |

---

## Copy Mode / Scrolling

| Action               | Shortcut        | Notes                                |
|----------------------|-----------------|---------------------------------------|
| Enter copy mode      | `prefix + [`    | Use arrows or vi keys if enabled     |
| Exit copy mode       | `q` or `Esc`    |                                      |
| Start selection      | `Space`         | In copy mode                         |
| Copy selection       | `Enter`         |                                      |
| Paste buffer         | `prefix + ]`    |                                      |

---

## Other Useful Commands

| Action                               | Command                                  | Notes                              |
|---------------------------------------|-------------------------------------------|-------------------------------------|
| Kill session                          | `tmux kill-session -t <name>`            |                                     |
| Kill all sessions except current     | `tmux kill-session -a`                   |                                     |
| Rename current window                | `tmux rename-window <name>`             | Same as `prefix + ,`               |
| Show all key bindings                | `tmux list-keys`                         |                                     |
| Show active sessions                 | `tmux ls`                                |                                     |

---

## Quick Muscle Memory

- `prefix` → `Ctrl + Space`  
- New Window: `prefix + c`  
- Split: `prefix + |` (vert) or `prefix + -` (horiz)  
- Close pane: `prefix + x`  
- Rename window: `prefix + ,`  
- List sessions: `prefix + s`  
- Switch panes: `prefix + Arrow`  
- Copy mode: `prefix + [`

